  "body": {
    "givenName": "Corroon",
    "image": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "contentUrl": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    "motivations": "I serve as a DRep because I believe Cardano offers a hopeful path toward more transparent, accountable, and community-led governance. Where traditional institutions can leave people feeling unheard, Cardano gives ADA holders a direct role in shaping its future.\n\nAs a long-time ADA holder and Nightforce Leader, I feel a personal responsibility to turn my conviction into active participation. I want to contribute my voice and judgment to protecting Cardano’s values and helping its governance mature.\n\nMy motivation is both idealistic and practical: to help build a fairer system while evaluating proposals carefully, seeking evidence, and remaining willing to reconsider my views.\n\nI am guided by integrity, truth-seeking, and respect for those who entrust me with their voting power. I believe thoughtful participation can help Cardano serve the long-term interests of its community and demonstrate what responsible decentralized governance can achieve.",
    "objectives": "I believe Cardano’s principled approach to blockchain can help build a more equitable future. As a long-time ADA holder and Nightforce Leader, I am committed to protecting its values of decentralization, liquid democracy, and sustainable growth.\n\nAs a DRep, I will work to:\n\n- Advance decentralization, scalability, and meaningful real-world adoption, including initiatives such as Midnight.\n- Support responsible treasury spending with clear goals, measurable outcomes, and accountability.\n- Encourage respectful, constructive dialogue across the community.\n- Exercise delegated voting power responsibly, prioritizing Cardano’s long-term health.\n\nI will vote transparently, explain my decisions publicly, and remain open to feedback and new evidence. My aim is to help Cardano deliver lasting value to its community and make a positive impact beyond it.\n\nGuiding principle: In ADA we trust.",
    "paymentAddress": "addr1q85eqt3rk3hwlsec245a2vczht29pmglnr2t7jvz235ydc8smff45j6vx4tnxr0mzkvm70yfmff0l0mlaq370z39xvvsfce6ef",
    "qualifications": "I bring practical experience in community leadership and Cardano governance participation. As a Nightforce Leader, I have developed skills in communication, consensus-building, and encouraging constructive engagement across the ecosystem.\n\nMy qualifications include:\n\n- Knowledge of Cardano’s vision, technology, and governance model developed through years of active involvement.\n- Community leadership experience supporting education, collaboration, and ecosystem growth.\n- A commitment to truth-seeking, intellectual honesty, and respectful discussion.\n- A consistent focus on Cardano’s long-term health, with principles that guide my decisions over personal financial gain.\n\nWhile I do not claim formal technical credentials, my contribution rests on practical experience, independent judgment, and a commitment to keep learning. I take seriously the responsibility of representing those who entrust me with their voting power.",
